Comment: 0,0:00:00.18,0:00:00.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“…Warmth of the Cold Wintry Wind”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.18,0:00:00.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato. 17 TL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.46,0:00:07.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’re having a bazaar at Yomogi Preschool today!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:09.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Please come take a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.20,0:00:15.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Squish?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.83,0:00:23.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Could that be you, Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:27.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you {\i1}know{\i0} anyone else who looks like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:29.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course it’s me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.59,0:00:32.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t keep your hand on me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.09,0:00:33.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:37.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ko… ba…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.68,0:00:42.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.60,0:00:46.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:50.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you taking a nap in the middle of the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.11,0:00:54.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you’re sleepy, you should go back home first so you can use the futon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.65,0:00:56.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m… I’m…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.03,0:00:59.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m not napping!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.18,0:00:00.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{opening}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.18,0:00:00.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“…The Mysterious Lifeform, #2”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.63,0:02:34.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened to you, Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.50,0:02:36.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you even ask?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:39.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Can’t you tell just by looking at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.93,0:02:41.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.76,0:02:46.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ummmm…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.85,0:02:52.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san, you look kind of muddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.19,0:02:55.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Grow a brain already!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.69,0:03:00.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1200)}Anyway, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.24,0:03:10.00,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s getting really dark and cloudy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:11.17,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,It’ll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.12,0:03:14.21,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sure it’ll get sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.71,0:03:16.38,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.30,0:03:21.63,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.63,0:03:24.89,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll bring something that’ll really sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.14,0:03:28.02,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:30.18,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.18,0:03:32.23,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t have anything like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.23,0:03:36.44,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m just tired of always pretending to be a stuffed animal at the preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.07,0:03:41.20,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m gonna head to that bear’s place and eat Baumkuchen until I’m stuffed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.41,0:03:53.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s always in the weirdest places.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.55,0:04:00.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,One long!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.80,0:04:01.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:03.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Four slices please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.38,0:04:04.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is the short piece ready yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.47,0:04:05.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,One coffee please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.43,0:04:09.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, yes, slices for three, coming right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.64,0:04:10.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is mine done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.93,0:04:12.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Please wait a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.39,0:04:13.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s getting made right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.85,0:04:15.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Slices for six all done!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.85,0:04:17.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What about the long?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.77,0:04:18.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:20.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Two more minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.07,0:04:22.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Business sure is booming, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.13,0:04:25.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I came up with a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.74,0:04:28.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And having another worker is important!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.95,0:04:31.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s make some variations next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.33,0:04:32.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Like with chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.37,0:04:33.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Not a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.62,0:04:35.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s keep ’em coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:37.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You two seem to be fitting in well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.21,0:04:42.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn’t know if it’d work out at first, but it’s like I’m riding the tide now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:45.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,My sarcasm doesn’t even work on you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:46.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.47,0:04:47.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.84,0:04:49.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.18,0:04:51.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’ve started a home delivery service too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.98,0:04:56.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,For you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.98,0:04:59.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, from Bear’s Baumkuchen Shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.82,0:05:01.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve been waiting for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.19,0:05:02.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.44,0:05:03.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.57,0:05:07.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re not the usual bird. A newcomer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.41,0:05:08.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.45,0:05:13.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see, a part-timer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:16.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,There was a time when I was doing a lot of part-time work too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.79,0:05:20.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I was getting quite the workload from my pushy employers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.38,0:05:22.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Anything else you have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.05,0:05:22.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:24.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah, that’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.55,0:05:27.88,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I once went to this labyrinthian mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.88,0:05:31.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It was such a mysterious place with a bunch of weird rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.27,0:05:36.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Seeing you guys so into this right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.37,0:05:40.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m close to completely forgetting who you guys used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.81,0:05:42.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This body isn’t bad, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.77,0:05:45.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Although it has a little too much fur.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.49,0:05:47.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as I’m careful, things work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.65,0:05:49.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s scary to think about how you get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.87,0:05:54.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like I’ve been like this since birth!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.91,0:06:00.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Really… These days it seems like it was just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.08,0:06:03.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,For us, it seems more like a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:07.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It feels like it’s been forever since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.77,0:06:09.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.24,0:06:12.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,When I think about it now, we never really stood a chance of winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.93,0:06:14.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We picked the wrong opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.68,0:06:17.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It was a completely one-sided fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.31,0:06:19.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It didn’t take much to bring us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.19,0:06:23.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I felt like I stepped on someone back then…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:25.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:26.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.61,0:06:31.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Genko-sama?! I-I’m so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:33.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s over already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.61,0:06:38.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Back then, we didn’t even have time\Nto get upset over something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:41.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, don’t say anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.42,0:06:44.88,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No matter how much you’re not convinced,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:46.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,the law is the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.13,0:06:53.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,For now, we have to keep making baumkuchen
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.05,0:06:55.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,and wait for things to simmer down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.52,0:06:57.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.18,0:07:01.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We were so close back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.17,0:07:03.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We weren’t close!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.69,0:07:06.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This is where you’re supposed to repent!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.15,0:07:10.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You mustn’t speak or even think that you were close!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.82,0:07:12.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.11,0:07:14.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If we try to pull something against the Celestial World again,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.32,0:07:17.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,we won’t get away with just being turned into bears and birds!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.79,0:07:19.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sure I’d end up a teddy bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.45,0:07:22.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And this guy would just be bird food!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.21,0:07:24.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I don’t want that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.04,0:07:26.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s not fair that you’re the one\Nwho gets to be a cute character!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.71,0:07:30.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,In any case, you definitely\Nshouldn’t stir up any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.63,0:07:31.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.49,0:07:33.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:38.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t eat that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.72,0:07:40.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s our precious merchandise!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.60,0:07:47.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,All I got in the end was one box.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.40,0:07:49.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What a stingy bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.65,0:07:54.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Now that I’ve gotten something\Nsweet, I’d like something salty next.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.49,0:07:59.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And then after something salty, I’ll have baumkuchen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.58,0:08:03.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anything salty around?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:04.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:10.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Something with soy sauce would be\Ngood. I’m really up for something salty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.97,0:08:15.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.39,0:08:17.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Something that’ll give my stomach a good kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.98,0:08:27.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’re you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.81,0:08:29.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I missed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.65,0:08:31.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? The ball came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:32.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.99,0:08:33.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.45,0:08:37.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Geez, all these freaking kids…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.25,0:08:40.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s so fun about playing around with a ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.55,0:08:52.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.09,0:08:56.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.09,0:09:00.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.06,0:09:01.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m not your food!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.73,0:09:05.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, who’s that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.23,0:09:06.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This is mine, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.98,0:09:09.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re not good enough for this baumkuchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.81,0:09:12.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don’t stop this now, I’ll burn you to a crisp…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.65,0:09:14.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.53,0:09:16.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.28,0:09:17.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.24,0:09:18.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.28,0:09:20.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it! You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.53,0:09:25.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if… I die… I won’t… give you… this box!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.79,0:09:30.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.34,0:09:34.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Water’s no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.35,0:09:45.39,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,This is pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.27,0:09:53.61,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,I might cough up something besides fire doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.75,0:10:11.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,My body’s heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.09,0:10:23.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It just never lets up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.27,0:10:34.32,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll dry up in a jiffy with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.33,0:10:55.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Drying machines are more intense than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.09,0:10:59.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a sec… where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.61,0:11:14.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.77,0:11:16.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that grocery…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.49,0:11:22.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You know, I sure am hungry…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.58,0:11:29.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.12,0:11:31.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll take my time eating this once I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.58,0:11:39.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m not some kid that can’t wait till he’s done with his errand…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:42.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I can’t, I can’t, I can’t!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:47.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What’s this delicious smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.65,0:11:58.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck is that mysterious lifeform?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.18,0:00:00.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,01 eyecatch}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.62,0:12:16.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome to Mocona Land!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.25,0:12:21.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You young ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.46,0:12:24.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t get lost while you enjoy yourselves here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.39,0:12:28.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Now then, go out there and have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.23,0:12:36.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I ended up in a strange place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.56,0:12:38.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.98,0:12:40.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That delicious smell…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:51.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It all looks so yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.62,0:12:57.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ow, ow, ow…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.67,0:13:00.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Now I’ve done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.21,0:13:01.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.60,0:13:06.22,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.02,0:13:13.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.93,0:13:16.27,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.27,0:13:19.69,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m a stuffed animal, but I’m not…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.73,0:13:23.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.65,0:13:26.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Otherwise someone’s going to take the baumkuchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.63,0:13:42.75,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.55,0:13:45.59,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,What’re they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.59,0:13:48.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll get you whichever one you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.09,0:13:50.14,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, don’t tell me…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.14,0:13:52.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Papa, get me that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.43,0:13:53.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.90,0:14:06.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Th-This is…!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.69,0:14:08.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.78,0:14:11.78,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,A shooting gallery?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.53,0:14:13.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:15.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn’t this great?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:19.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Papa, I want that blue doggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.17,0:14:21.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s see…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.21,0:14:23.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s see…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.42,0:14:26.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.05,0:14:30.34,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.11,0:14:49.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So close!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.15,0:14:51.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I missed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.32,0:14:55.76,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,Hahaha, as if!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.45,0:14:58.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This time I’ll get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.42,0:15:01.50,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.50,0:15:02.63,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,This is…!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:05.17,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,On course for a direct hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.42,0:15:09.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You missed again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.80,0:15:11.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So close!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:13.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.01,0:15:15.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, I’ll get it for sure next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.98,0:15:21.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Did it just move?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.64,0:15:23.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It didn’t move!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.02,0:15:24.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You just suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.77,0:15:29.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it, that just makes me want to get it more!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.86,0:15:31.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Papa, you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.20,0:15:33.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, I’ll get it no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.57,0:15:35.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if you’ll get it this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.20,0:15:37.12,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.12,0:15:40.46,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,Be a nice man and give up instead of getting upset!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.71,0:15:44.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So close!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:47.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll go for it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.68,0:15:56.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’ll help too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.89,0:16:00.81,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,Demons!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:07.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We can’t get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.82,0:16:10.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.57,0:16:17.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Despite my appearances, long ago people used to call me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.20,0:16:20.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,the dreaded “Gallery Shooter Okana-chan.”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:30.96,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,Who the freaking hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.54,0:16:43.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:45.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s no good if it doesn’t drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.48,0:16:46.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.40,0:16:48.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.84,0:16:51.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then let’s all combine our powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.23,0:16:54.20,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:16.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why won’t that blue one fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.26,0:17:18.97,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,Like hell I’d let myself become some kid’s plaything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.02,0:17:26.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.73,0:17:31.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.03,0:17:34.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.95,0:17:37.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.57,0:17:39.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I can’t find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.44,0:17:40.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.20,0:17:41.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It did fall just now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:44.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, we all saw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.75,0:17:46.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.01,0:17:58.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That was terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.51,0:18:00.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I should be fine after coming this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.39,0:18:08.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So that’s what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.62,0:18:11.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So? The posters you put up were torn down,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.83,0:18:14.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,and you’ve been running around all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.63,0:18:17.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But no one was coming to the bazaar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.40,0:18:20.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it’s such a small event, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.57,0:18:26.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It was crazier to expect a lot of people to come to a bazaar at a preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.54,0:18:31.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If I had known this would happen, maybe it would’ve been better
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.21,0:18:34.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,if I hadn’t brought up the idea of the bazaar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.63,0:18:36.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:39.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s important is that you set out to do what you said you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.63,0:18:42.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if there are bumps in the road, you shouldn’t give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.51,0:18:45.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.72,0:18:49.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you get drenched in\Nwater and attacked by snipers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.89,0:18:50.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.69,0:18:52.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it’s nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.65,0:18:55.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, what’s important is doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.65,0:18:58.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t feel so dejected just\Nbecause people aren’t coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.20,0:19:00.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.36,0:19:01.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.20,0:19:05.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.87,0:19:09.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.75,0:19:13.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back, Kobato-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.42,0:19:14.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re late!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.88,0:19:17.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, look, we’ve sold so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.76,0:19:19.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The teru teru bozu are selling too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.55,0:19:24.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks to you, Kobato-san,\NI got an unexpectedly good find.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:34.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,How long are you going to just stand there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.61,0:19:37.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.44,0:19:40.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at all the customers. We need more help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.74,0:19:44.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.32,0:19:46.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry and help out too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.24,0:19:49.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.62,0:19:50.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.62,0:19:53.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:57.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s thanks to you that all these people came.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:19:59.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,N-No, I didn’t…!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.17,0:20:00.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.51,0:20:04.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone’s enjoying themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.76,0:20:07.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s thanks to you, Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.14,0:20:11.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.18,0:20:12.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Doumoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.77,0:20:15.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for taking the time to come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.86,0:20:17.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.61,0:20:19.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I had a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.19,0:20:21.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s great!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.74,0:20:26.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But I would’ve liked to have bought something directly from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.78,0:20:28.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,O-Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.33,0:20:30.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I had a stall too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.58,0:20:31.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.17,0:20:37.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,They aren’t selling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.17,0:20:39.00,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, that’s natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.00,0:20:41.93,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s not like anyone would\Nwant this mysterious lifeform
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.93,0:20:46.11,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,when you can’t even tell if it’s\Na chicken, penguin, sheep or what.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.34,0:20:47.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I’ll buy one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:49.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.97,0:20:50.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.81,0:20:53.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.89,0:20:56.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It is a rather unique sense of taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.65,0:20:58.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Just what I’d expect from you, Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.07,0:21:02.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it a rabbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.07,0:21:05.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,D-Doumoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:17.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Today was a wonderful day!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.71,0:21:19.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It was terrible for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.54,0:21:20.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.71,0:21:21.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.84,0:21:24.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Weren’t you listening to my story?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.63,0:21:26.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.76,0:21:28.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.09,0:21:29.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“Really”, my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.97,0:21:35.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I did protect what’s important to me, so I guess it’s all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.06,0:21:37.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll scarf it down as soon as I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.23,0:21:40.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I’ll take my time to eat that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.48,0:21:41.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“That”?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.44,0:21:42.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.73,0:21:44.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,By “that”, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.99,0:21:45.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.95,0:21:46.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.90,0:21:48.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,My baumkuchen is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.86,0:21:52.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine then. We’re going back to the preschool to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.03,0:21:55.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, we sold that baumkuchen right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.99,0:22:00.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Y-You did what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.54,0:22:07.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That thing you said would really\Nsell was that baumkuchen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.68,0:22:14.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.27,0:22:19.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Your score for today was 80 points\Nfor your passion towards the bazaar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.90,0:22:20.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.61,0:22:26.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Including my disappointment, -300 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.53,0:22:31.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why, Ioryogi-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.70,0:22:33.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you disappointed because of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.53,0:22:34.91,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I’ll apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.91,0:22:37.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Apologizing won’t solve anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.00,0:22:40.88,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Then I’ll give you one of my cute rabbits!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.88,0:22:42.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’ll make you feel better!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.34,0:22:43.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t need it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.17,0:22:45.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Then I’ll give you an extra one!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.84,0:22:47.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I said I don’t need it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.34,0:22:50.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I’ll give you this cute bear and sheep!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.51,0:22:52.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I can’t tell what they are in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.68,0:22:54.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,They’re all mysterious lifeforms!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.85,0:22:59.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1600)}How mean, Ioryogi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.31,0:05:38.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
